================================================================================

        U L T I M A T E   M O R P H   C R E A T O R   3
        (Toilet World Roleplay 2)

        Custom morphs made easy in your private server, on a phone or a PC,
        the way the game makes them: with its own building tools (Fork3x or
        BTools) and its Save Morph Tool. It builds nothing itself and calls
        none of the game's remotes: it uses Fork3x as you would (its keys,
        your mouse), so what the others see is what Fork3x builds. What it
        shows is only on your screen.

          * Add a Piece: you pick the piece and move it onto your morph; it
            is grouped five times, your morph clicked with Ctrl held,
            grouped, ungrouped (inside it), then welded, all for you
          * Fix All: each part that would fall, welded for you to the body
            part it belongs to
          * Test Morph: onto its pad, thawed, and back where you were;
            Go To any morph; Undo Guide
          * a bar at the top says each step; the menu hides meanwhile;
            where a click cannot be done for you, you tap it
          * the pad for phones (Group, Ungroup, Select In, Multi, Undo,
            Redo, Weld, Menu); Alt + a key on a PC
          * colours and effects tried on your screen first, their codes
          * the catalog's accessories and the toolbox's models: their ids,
            mesh and texture for Fork3x's Mesh tool

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/UltimateMorphCreator"))()

        Its window is Obsidian's (deividcomsono/Obsidian). getgenv().__UMCStop()
        closes it and puts back all it showed.

================================================================================
